    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get in touch via studio@emergo-entertainment.de!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Passengers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your passengers so everyone is happy. Happy passengers will give a gracious tip for you to buy new modules for your train while unhappy passengers will eventually leave out of frustration. Once three passengers left, it\u2019s game over; so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b278adaec5f7712d575de09802d26e79.poster.avif?t=1754157055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b278adaec5f7712d575de09802d26e79.webm?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b278adaec5f7712d575de09802d26e79.mp4?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Furnish your Train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your train car with seats, a snack machine, a bar or even a music corner! Trains don\u2019t have to be boring and your passengers will demand the most fun ride they can get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/da8cdfa30ecf5c9f45c22749d332cff2.poster.avif?t=1754157055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/da8cdfa30ecf5c9f45c22749d332cff2.webm?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/da8cdfa30ecf5c9f45c22749d332cff2.mp4?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy and Unlock Modules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your train at each stop making it more accommodating for passengers. The shop lets you purchase new modules from the money you received. Finishing a run will unlock new modules you can use to complete harder routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/86dd6de8caf0dfce85e6be76e85fc44d.poster.avif?t=1754157055\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/86dd6de8caf0dfce85e6be76e85fc44d.webm?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/86dd6de8caf0dfce85e6be76e85fc44d.mp4?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel Europe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the playtest, you\u2019ll be travelling our home region of Bavaria. However, the final game will include much of Europe. Maybe you\u2019ll even find a cool town for your next holiday!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b57090990d0cbb59d9771cde8bcc0ca1.poster.avif?t=1754157055\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b57090990d0cbb59d9771cde8bcc0ca1.webm?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b57090990d0cbb59d9771cde8bcc0ca1.mp4?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Jumble is still in active development! So we're always looking for feedback &amp; ideas! Join our Discord server to discuss the game and hang out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get in touch via studio@emergo-entertainment.de!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Passengers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your passengers so everyone is happy. Happy passengers will give a gracious tip for you to buy new modules for your train while unhappy passengers will eventually leave out of frustration. Once three passengers left, it\u2019s game over; so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b278adaec5f7712d575de09802d26e79.poster.avif?t=1754157055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b278adaec5f7712d575de09802d26e79.webm?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b278adaec5f7712d575de09802d26e79.mp4?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Furnish your Train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your train car with seats, a snack machine, a bar or even a music corner! Trains don\u2019t have to be boring and your passengers will demand the most fun ride they can get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/da8cdfa30ecf5c9f45c22749d332cff2.poster.avif?t=1754157055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/da8cdfa30ecf5c9f45c22749d332cff2.webm?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/da8cdfa30ecf5c9f45c22749d332cff2.mp4?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy and Unlock Modules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your train at each stop making it more accommodating for passengers. The shop lets you purchase new modules from the money you received. Finishing a run will unlock new modules you can use to complete harder routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/86dd6de8caf0dfce85e6be76e85fc44d.poster.avif?t=1754157055\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/86dd6de8caf0dfce85e6be76e85fc44d.webm?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/86dd6de8caf0dfce85e6be76e85fc44d.mp4?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel Europe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the playtest, you\u2019ll be travelling our home region of Bavaria. However, the final game will include much of Europe. Maybe you\u2019ll even find a cool town for your next holiday!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b57090990d0cbb59d9771cde8bcc0ca1.poster.avif?t=1754157055\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b57090990d0cbb59d9771cde8bcc0ca1.webm?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/b57090990d0cbb59d9771cde8bcc0ca1.mp4?t=1754157055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Jumble is still in active development! So we're always looking for feedback &amp; ideas! Join our Discord server to discuss the game and hang out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
